# Debate and Voting
Planning, feature, architecture, blocker and trade-off decisions use a visible team debate. Three specialists produce independent positions and evidence. Approval requires at least 2 of 3 matching approvals. If consensus fails, escalate to RAT. Persist the complete debate and vote record under `docs/debat/` and `.brain/` before implementation.
